1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,105
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00:12,375 --> 00:00:14,250
I am old.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,750
It's time to step down.

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,416
This position

5
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,833
will be passed on to Fixer Lunar.

6
00:00:24,541 --> 00:00:28,083
Nobody should have a problem with that, right?

7
00:00:35,083 --> 00:00:38,291
If there are any concerns, state them.

8
00:00:53,375 --> 00:00:55,833
This is a chairpersons' meeting.

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,833
Why did you bring Fixer Solar in?

10
00:01:00,875 --> 00:01:02,083
Here's the thing.

11
00:01:02,583 --> 00:01:05,708
About the succession of Fixer Celestial,

12
00:01:06,833 --> 00:01:10,083
I believe it is not your decision to make.

13
00:01:10,166 --> 00:01:12,625
That is the tradition.

14
00:01:12,708 --> 00:01:15,833
It is not your place to speak on this.

15
00:01:15,916 --> 00:01:18,875
Fixer Celestial, I have always respected you.

16
00:01:19,666 --> 00:01:21,333
However, we discovered

17
00:01:21,416 --> 00:01:24,833
that the murder of Ching He's fixers

18
00:01:24,916 --> 00:01:26,625
is connected to you.

19
00:01:27,458 --> 00:01:31,041
So we must postpone handing over the position of Fixer Celestial

20
00:01:31,541 --> 00:01:33,041
to your daughter.

21
00:01:37,208 --> 00:01:39,125
All of you have discussed this

22
00:01:40,291 --> 00:01:43,166
among yourselves, haven't you?

23
00:01:43,916 --> 00:01:45,791
Do you really believe

24
00:01:46,625 --> 00:01:48,166
that this matter

25
00:01:48,750 --> 00:01:50,333
is related to me?

26
00:01:55,791 --> 00:01:57,625
I know

27
00:01:58,583 --> 00:02:00,333
you feel wronged.

28
00:02:00,833 --> 00:02:02,958
Thackery Huang…

29
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:07,958
will never be

30
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,916
Ching He's

31
00:02:11,541 --> 00:02:13,750
true master.

32
00:02:16,541 --> 00:02:18,083
You are.

33
00:02:20,083 --> 00:02:20,916
Dad.

34
00:02:22,916 --> 00:02:26,291
You must take back the position

35
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,333
that belongs to you.

36
00:02:29,416 --> 00:02:31,208
Only you

37
00:02:32,125 --> 00:02:35,375
are qualified to be Fixer Celestial.

38
00:02:36,666 --> 00:02:38,375
Make both sides of the law

39
00:02:39,375 --> 00:02:40,875
fear you…

40
00:02:43,166 --> 00:02:44,875
and respect you.

41
00:03:05,250 --> 00:03:07,458
THE FIXERS

42
00:03:08,708 --> 00:03:12,083
THE FIX

43
00:03:20,041 --> 00:03:21,708
Is anyone home?

44
00:03:22,791 --> 00:03:23,750
I'm back.

45
00:03:34,416 --> 00:03:36,458
Lord Guan, I'm sorry.

46
00:03:36,541 --> 00:03:40,458
Beside the lake, beneath the trees. I'll leave my money with you, praise be.

47
00:03:42,583 --> 00:03:45,000
So much for their "buy one, get one free" sale.

48
00:03:45,083 --> 00:03:47,416
I went all the way there, and then what?

49
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:49,166
I only got one bag.

50
00:03:49,666 --> 00:03:52,291
Why did I even bother? Seriously.

51
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,833
Why didn't you turn on the lights?

52
00:03:55,916 --> 00:03:57,583
Didn't you pray this morning?

53
00:03:57,666 --> 00:03:59,000
Did you do something bad?

54
00:03:59,083 --> 00:04:01,041
Prayer protects. Better safe than sorry.

55
00:04:01,125 --> 00:04:02,833
That had better be the case.

56
00:04:05,125 --> 00:04:06,041
Look.

57
00:04:06,541 --> 00:04:09,375
You act all sneaky even when you're just on your phone.

58
00:04:09,458 --> 00:04:11,166
Do you really have another woman?

59
00:04:11,250 --> 00:04:12,333
Don't worry.

60
00:04:12,416 --> 00:04:14,208
Nobody wants an old swamp eel like me.

61
00:04:14,291 --> 00:04:17,291
You're my second, third, fourth, and fifth woman.

62
00:04:17,375 --> 00:04:18,875
I can't escape from your grasp.

63
00:04:18,958 --> 00:04:21,458
Look at your dad. Don't be like him.

64
00:04:21,541 --> 00:04:24,000
All smooth and glib.

65
00:04:24,083 --> 00:04:26,541
-Blah blah blah. -You chose him.

66
00:04:26,625 --> 00:04:29,000
Did I raise you to talk back to me like this?

67
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,708
Welcome.

68
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:34,458
Hey, a good dog doesn't get in the way.

69
00:04:34,541 --> 00:04:35,791
Hey, buddy.

70
00:04:35,875 --> 00:04:37,291
This is for you.

71
00:04:39,458 --> 00:04:41,541
I'm so sorry that I made you go on leave.

72
00:04:41,625 --> 00:04:43,833
Consider this an apology.

73
00:04:50,541 --> 00:04:51,375
Forgot me?

74
00:04:51,458 --> 00:04:52,916
Scallion or pork floss?

75
00:04:55,666 --> 00:04:57,333
He's treating you to a bun.

76
00:04:57,416 --> 00:04:59,333
Scallion, of course. I like scallions.

77
00:04:59,416 --> 00:05:01,458
You're too kind. Thanks.

78
00:05:03,333 --> 00:05:07,041
Hey, I say, this partner of yours is quite weird.

79
00:05:07,125 --> 00:05:08,875
Only weirdos can be partners with me.

80
00:05:09,375 --> 00:05:11,541
Of course. You're so hard to get along with.

81
00:05:17,416 --> 00:05:18,875
How's it with the police?

82
00:05:18,958 --> 00:05:20,041
Welcome.

83
00:05:20,125 --> 00:05:23,333
We need you to come down to the station to answer a few questions.

84
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,125
They have no evidence.

85
00:05:25,750 --> 00:05:27,916
They can't do anything to me.

86
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:30,291
Glad you're okay. We're waiting for you to return.

87
00:05:30,375 --> 00:05:31,416
Hey, all together.

88
00:05:33,750 --> 00:05:35,083
I'm not going back.

89
00:05:35,625 --> 00:05:37,208
I'm getting old, man.

90
00:05:37,291 --> 00:05:40,250
Besides, I've made enough in the last few years. I'm set.

91
00:05:40,333 --> 00:05:42,916
Can you really watch me paired up with this wily old fox?

92
00:05:44,375 --> 00:05:45,666
Hey, listen.

93
00:05:45,750 --> 00:05:48,541
You had it tough working with such a difficult partner.

94
00:05:50,708 --> 00:05:52,375
He's just guarded.

95
00:05:52,458 --> 00:05:54,541
He has a sharp tongue but a soft heart.

96
00:05:54,625 --> 00:05:56,666
I know. A razor tongue, a heart like a girl.

97
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:58,500
Big nostrils, and eyes like pearls.

98
00:05:59,333 --> 00:06:01,541
-If anything comes up, tell Ching He. -Okay.

99
00:06:01,625 --> 00:06:02,625
Pay for yourself.

100
00:06:05,333 --> 00:06:07,375
I'll charge you 40 for these two.

101
00:06:07,458 --> 00:06:08,416
-Buddy. -This is 100.

102
00:06:08,500 --> 00:06:10,916
Buddy, you don't have to do that. It's fine.

103
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,500
It's all right. No worries.

104
00:06:12,583 --> 00:06:13,416
No worries.

105
00:06:14,250 --> 00:06:15,083
You're back.

106
00:06:15,166 --> 00:06:16,708
-We're home. -Give it to me.

107
00:06:16,791 --> 00:06:18,666
Here, the backpack is so heavy.

108
00:06:19,541 --> 00:06:20,375
Thank you.

109
00:06:20,458 --> 00:06:22,000
-So heavy. -Let me see your hands.

110
00:06:23,666 --> 00:06:26,750
How did anyone know that Fixer Shadow shot Noods?

111
00:06:27,250 --> 00:06:29,041
I didn't report it. It's not me.

112
00:06:29,625 --> 00:06:32,125
Fixer Expunge and Fixer Annul cleaned up the scene.

113
00:06:32,708 --> 00:06:34,375
There shouldn't have been any trace.

114
00:06:34,958 --> 00:06:36,250
Should we look into it?

115
00:06:36,333 --> 00:06:39,083
No, I've already sent someone to handle it.

116
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,375
We have a tricky request this time.

117
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:48,291
The client is Hsiu of San He.

118
00:06:48,791 --> 00:06:52,333
He is the right-hand man of San He's boss, Lin Wan-li.

119
00:06:52,833 --> 00:06:54,541
Lin Wan-li has gone missing.

120
00:06:54,625 --> 00:06:56,250
And someone saw

121
00:06:56,333 --> 00:06:58,583
that Hsiu's men kidnapped him.

122
00:06:59,166 --> 00:07:00,916
But Hsiu says that they didn't do it.

123
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:04,458
He suspects that Lin Kuei-pin is behind it all.

124
00:07:10,208 --> 00:07:14,666
Did you know that San He's boss, Lin Wan-li, was kidnapped?

125
00:07:15,166 --> 00:07:16,250
Yes.

126
00:07:16,333 --> 00:07:19,583
I heard that it was Lin Wan-li's deputy, Hsiu.

127
00:07:19,666 --> 00:07:22,625
If San He starts fighting amongst themselves,

128
00:07:23,125 --> 00:07:25,333
do you know what to do next?

129
00:07:26,125 --> 00:07:29,875
Do you mean his rival, Lin Kuei-pin?

130
00:07:29,958 --> 00:07:32,291
Lin Wan-li is old.

131
00:07:32,791 --> 00:07:36,458
Word is that two people in San He are gunning for the position.

132
00:07:36,541 --> 00:07:39,916
One is Lin Wan-li's younger brother, Lin Kuei-pin.

133
00:07:40,500 --> 00:07:41,500
Come on!

134
00:07:41,583 --> 00:07:44,083
The other one is Hsiu.

135
00:07:44,166 --> 00:07:47,416
Of the two, one is a hawk, and the other is a dove.

136
00:07:47,916 --> 00:07:48,833
They always clash.

137
00:07:53,083 --> 00:07:54,583
Why did you run up here?

138
00:07:56,666 --> 00:07:58,708
All your brothers are down there.

139
00:07:58,791 --> 00:08:00,625
Do you know what loyalty is?

140
00:08:01,541 --> 00:08:04,333
If you sneak up here, how could you face your boss, Hsiu?

141
00:08:04,416 --> 00:08:06,250
-After Lin Wan-li went missing… -Fuck!

142
00:08:06,333 --> 00:08:08,833
…Lin Kuei-pin began making moves on Hsiu's turf.

143
00:08:08,916 --> 00:08:11,125
He demands that he hand over his brother.

144
00:08:11,208 --> 00:08:12,583
There's no way

145
00:08:13,083 --> 00:08:16,166
the guy won't jump at the opportunity to make a move.

146
00:08:16,791 --> 00:08:20,666
The current mayor's much-touted "city of happiness and excellence"

147
00:08:21,166 --> 00:08:23,375
has become a breeding ground for organized crime.

148
00:08:24,041 --> 00:08:25,791
A new headline for the reporters.

149
00:08:25,875 --> 00:08:28,416
Shall we help push it along?

150
00:08:36,666 --> 00:08:38,333
Tell your boss, Hsiu,

151
00:08:38,416 --> 00:08:42,041
that I'll pay my respects every day until he hands over my brother.

152
00:08:43,458 --> 00:08:44,625
Lin Kuei-pin!

153
00:08:45,333 --> 00:08:46,291
Are you mad?

154
00:08:48,500 --> 00:08:49,875
What are you doing here?

155
00:08:52,250 --> 00:08:53,541
Don't you know what you did?

156
00:08:53,625 --> 00:08:55,333
How could my men have touched Wan?

157
00:08:55,416 --> 00:08:57,333
If you refuse to tell the truth,

158
00:08:58,250 --> 00:08:59,625
there's nothing I can do.

159
00:09:03,083 --> 00:09:03,916
Let's go!

160
00:09:10,458 --> 00:09:12,916
After all, they're all part of San He.

161
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:15,708
Hsiu doesn't want both sides to suffer.

162
00:09:16,208 --> 00:09:20,333
That's why Hsiu hired Ching He

163
00:09:20,416 --> 00:09:22,208
to help find Lin Wan-li.

164
00:09:22,291 --> 00:09:25,458
This can also prove that Lin Wan-li's disappearance

165
00:09:25,541 --> 00:09:27,875
has nothing to do with him.

166
00:09:31,375 --> 00:09:32,666
I'm not taking this case.

167
00:09:33,708 --> 00:09:37,583
No fixer has ever dared refuse a case assigned by Ching He.

168
00:09:38,791 --> 00:09:40,875
You used to be a member of San He.

169
00:09:40,958 --> 00:09:42,958
You know how they work best.

170
00:09:43,041 --> 00:09:44,333
Why won't you take it?

171
00:09:48,333 --> 00:09:50,166
Anyway, I can't take this case.

172
00:09:50,250 --> 00:09:51,500
Find someone else.

173
00:09:52,291 --> 00:09:55,041
Have you forgotten the rules for fixers?

174
00:10:02,958 --> 00:10:04,125
Don't worry.

175
00:10:04,208 --> 00:10:05,333
We will handle it.

176
00:10:17,375 --> 00:10:18,500
Why did you say no?

177
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,708
A personal grudge against San He?

178
00:10:21,250 --> 00:10:23,166
That's my past. Don't ask.

179
00:10:23,250 --> 00:10:25,916
Just like I don't ask about your business.

180
00:10:26,416 --> 00:10:27,416
Got it?

181
00:11:05,375 --> 00:11:08,208
TRUTH IS STRANGER THAN FICTION

182
00:11:16,958 --> 00:11:20,000
Roses are red, violets are blue.

183
00:11:23,416 --> 00:11:25,916
I'll take you down a peg or two.

184
00:11:26,416 --> 00:11:27,375
Cocky, eh?

185
00:11:27,458 --> 00:11:29,166
A master of pen and sword.

186
00:11:29,250 --> 00:11:31,750
Out of everyone in San He, you're the most cultured.

187
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:33,625
I, Chen Liang-chi,

188
00:11:34,125 --> 00:11:35,583
was supposed to wield a pen.

189
00:11:35,666 --> 00:11:37,166
Now I'm wielding a gun.

190
00:11:37,666 --> 00:11:38,958
That's why

191
00:11:39,041 --> 00:11:41,791
I'm going to send my daughter abroad for school

192
00:11:42,291 --> 00:11:44,125
so she can see the world for me.

193
00:11:44,791 --> 00:11:45,750
Nice.

194
00:11:46,250 --> 00:11:47,833
-Your turn. -I'll go.

195
00:11:50,041 --> 00:11:51,250
"Violets."

196
00:11:52,833 --> 00:11:53,708
"Are."

197
00:11:55,375 --> 00:11:56,333
"Blue."

198
00:11:58,875 --> 00:12:00,458
Holy crap.

199
00:12:00,541 --> 00:12:02,625
Two years of practice beaten in two months.

200
00:12:03,416 --> 00:12:04,500
Did you dope?

201
00:12:05,500 --> 00:12:07,416
This is nothing. Give me two more months.

202
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:09,416
I'll even be able to hit a fly, I tell you.

203
00:12:09,500 --> 00:12:11,583
Goodness, that's incredible.

204
00:12:11,666 --> 00:12:12,875
Okay, one day,

205
00:12:12,958 --> 00:12:15,666
we'll have you perform fly-shooting for Wan.

206
00:12:15,750 --> 00:12:17,250
You'll rise through the ranks.

207
00:12:18,458 --> 00:12:22,083
The first boss to rise to power by shooting flies.

208
00:12:23,541 --> 00:12:25,958
Fall, leaves, fall; die, flowers, away.

209
00:12:27,583 --> 00:12:28,666
"Fall."

210
00:12:30,833 --> 00:12:34,125
Rise to power making flies my prey.

211
00:12:35,416 --> 00:12:38,291
Come on, Boss Fly.

212
00:12:46,333 --> 00:12:49,541
NOTHING IS SO BEAUTIFUL AS SPRING

213
00:12:53,666 --> 00:12:55,833
SPRING

214
00:13:12,291 --> 00:13:13,125
Looking for me?

215
00:13:15,125 --> 00:13:16,958
What have you been up to lately?

216
00:13:20,125 --> 00:13:22,250
Being the youngest son of a political dynasty,

217
00:13:22,333 --> 00:13:24,041
who is very obedient to his dad

218
00:13:24,125 --> 00:13:25,500
and keeps a very low profile.

219
00:13:28,166 --> 00:13:29,541
What kind of attitude is that?

220
00:13:29,625 --> 00:13:31,291
How could you talk to Dad like that?

221
00:13:32,458 --> 00:13:33,500
What's wrong?

222
00:13:33,583 --> 00:13:36,666
You're coming to our family's ancestral worship this year.

223
00:13:36,750 --> 00:13:39,083
Every major media outlet will be there.

224
00:13:39,583 --> 00:13:42,625
Learn from your brother how to handle them.

225
00:13:42,708 --> 00:13:45,083
Learn more from him, understand?

226
00:13:45,166 --> 00:13:46,375
Be his lackey?

227
00:13:46,458 --> 00:13:48,166
You are part of the Hsueh family.

228
00:13:48,250 --> 00:13:49,666
Stop idling around all day.

229
00:13:49,750 --> 00:13:51,458
You still remember that I'm a Hsueh?

230
00:13:52,708 --> 00:13:55,791
Aren't you embarrassed to be seen with me?

231
00:13:55,875 --> 00:13:57,791
Just do as I say.

232
00:13:58,791 --> 00:14:00,333
If you really don't want to go,

233
00:14:00,833 --> 00:14:02,000
then don't!

234
00:14:20,416 --> 00:14:23,666
Dad only did this because he wants to patch things up with you.

235
00:14:24,250 --> 00:14:27,458
No matter what I do, I will never become a good son to him.

236
00:14:28,583 --> 00:14:30,250
Don't let me drag you into this.

237
00:14:35,708 --> 00:14:38,166
Haven't you always wanted his approval?

238
00:14:39,208 --> 00:14:41,500
Dad has always hoped you could come home and help.

239
00:14:43,250 --> 00:14:44,375
I do too.

240
00:14:45,666 --> 00:14:48,916
I need someone whom I can truly trust to help me.

241
00:14:51,166 --> 00:14:54,125
You are incredibly adept

242
00:14:54,208 --> 00:14:55,916
at reading power dynamics.

243
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,583
I need your advice.

244
00:14:58,125 --> 00:15:00,333
I also want to show Dad what you're capable of.

245
00:15:42,833 --> 00:15:45,208
DADDY NOT HERE?

246
00:15:51,958 --> 00:15:54,791
ARE YOU ALONE?

247
00:15:56,625 --> 00:15:57,541
Sorry.

248
00:15:58,125 --> 00:16:00,958
Sorry for making you wait. I was tidying up in the back.

249
00:16:02,208 --> 00:16:03,791
Exactly 100 dollars.

250
00:16:04,416 --> 00:16:06,291
It's rather late, so there are discounts.

251
00:16:06,375 --> 00:16:07,291
Thank you.

252
00:16:07,791 --> 00:16:08,916
You have a good child.

253
00:16:27,791 --> 00:16:28,833
You're back.

254
00:16:29,750 --> 00:16:30,958
I'm back.

255
00:16:37,625 --> 00:16:41,333
DADDY NOT HERE? ARE YOU ALONE?

256
00:16:44,875 --> 00:16:46,375
THE WAY OF THREE HARMONIES

257
00:16:46,458 --> 00:16:50,416
Don't let anyone else know that I'm meeting with you, officer.

258
00:16:50,916 --> 00:16:52,750
After all, it's tricky given who we are.

259
00:16:52,833 --> 00:16:53,875
I understand.

260
00:16:54,875 --> 00:16:57,125
Has Lin Wan-li made any enemies recently?

261
00:16:57,208 --> 00:16:58,041
DETECTIVE

262
00:16:58,125 --> 00:17:01,083
He is nearing retirement. He values harmony above all else.

263
00:17:01,166 --> 00:17:03,416
He's unlikely to have conflicts with anyone.

264
00:17:05,041 --> 00:17:07,166
In fact, Wan has already made arrangements.

265
00:17:07,250 --> 00:17:09,000
He knew he was getting on in years.

266
00:17:09,083 --> 00:17:11,458
He wrote his will a while ago.

267
00:17:11,958 --> 00:17:13,000
Word is that

268
00:17:13,083 --> 00:17:15,625
Lin Wan-li's abduction

269
00:17:15,708 --> 00:17:17,666
is connected to Lin Kuei-pin and Hsiu.

270
00:17:17,750 --> 00:17:18,875
Impossible.

271
00:17:18,958 --> 00:17:20,500
One is his younger brother.

272
00:17:20,583 --> 00:17:22,750
-And he practically raised Hsiu. -Yu.

273
00:17:24,666 --> 00:17:26,333
I heard that the police came by.

274
00:17:26,875 --> 00:17:28,375
How come you didn't tell me?

275
00:17:28,958 --> 00:17:30,416
I didn't have time to tell you.

276
00:17:32,416 --> 00:17:33,666
Officer,

277
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:35,958
what do you want to know?

278
00:17:36,458 --> 00:17:39,458
Pin, the police came to help find your brother.

279
00:17:39,541 --> 00:17:40,958
Which unit are you from?

280
00:17:41,666 --> 00:17:43,208
Who sent you here?

281
00:17:51,291 --> 00:17:53,041
Wan? Wan, is it you?

282
00:17:54,666 --> 00:17:56,583
What is that sound? Hello?

283
00:17:57,583 --> 00:17:58,666
Put it on speaker.

284
00:18:00,041 --> 00:18:00,875
Wan?

285
00:18:02,291 --> 00:18:04,791
-Wan? -In three days. On a bus.

286
00:18:04,875 --> 00:18:06,333
The ransom is one million.

287
00:18:06,833 --> 00:18:09,250
Only Lin Wan-li's wife can board the bus.

288
00:18:09,750 --> 00:18:13,083
If we see that someone is following, we will kill him at once.

289
00:18:13,583 --> 00:18:14,875
Hey, can you let me--

290
00:18:17,041 --> 00:18:18,375
Did I hear that correctly?

291
00:18:18,458 --> 00:18:20,791
A ransom of one million dollars?

292
00:18:21,833 --> 00:18:22,666
Motherfucker!

293
00:18:23,541 --> 00:18:24,833
Are they insulting us?

294
00:18:25,333 --> 00:18:27,083
We suggest that you do not act yet.

295
00:18:27,166 --> 00:18:29,000
Let the police handle it.

296
00:18:29,083 --> 00:18:30,875
This is a family matter. We've got it.

297
00:18:30,958 --> 00:18:32,500
-We don't need the police. -Pin.

298
00:18:32,583 --> 00:18:35,291
You're only putting him in more danger this way.

299
00:18:35,958 --> 00:18:36,791
See him out!

300
00:18:37,500 --> 00:18:38,833
Officer, please.

301
00:18:52,291 --> 00:18:55,000
HUNG HSING BAKERY

302
00:18:55,083 --> 00:18:58,000
Strange. Why did he close so early?

303
00:19:00,083 --> 00:19:01,791
He didn't put things away.

304
00:19:45,083 --> 00:19:47,208
HU TUNG-YU, FIXER SHADOW, AGE 43

305
00:19:47,291 --> 00:19:50,000
STATUS: DECEASED

306
00:19:57,291 --> 00:20:00,041
Fixer Terra, what brings you here?

307
00:20:01,333 --> 00:20:03,833
Some things are better said in person.

308
00:20:05,166 --> 00:20:07,125
As your old friend,

309
00:20:07,208 --> 00:20:09,208
I have to warn you about something.

310
00:20:09,958 --> 00:20:11,708
Do you want to talk to me

311
00:20:11,791 --> 00:20:13,375
about the recent rumors

312
00:20:13,458 --> 00:20:15,000
that Ching He

313
00:20:15,500 --> 00:20:16,833
leaked our secrets

314
00:20:17,416 --> 00:20:18,625
to the police

315
00:20:19,125 --> 00:20:22,250
and even tried to eliminate our own fixers?

316
00:20:24,333 --> 00:20:26,791
It's not just us who know the news.

317
00:20:27,708 --> 00:20:30,125
Our clients know too.

318
00:20:30,625 --> 00:20:33,041
Several clients wanted to hire us.

319
00:20:33,625 --> 00:20:36,833
But they all backed out suddenly in the last few days.

320
00:20:37,916 --> 00:20:40,666
Someone is obviously behind the rumors.

321
00:20:41,416 --> 00:20:43,541
Why should we throw ourselves into a panic?

322
00:20:44,041 --> 00:20:47,958
If clients feel that Ching He cannot guard their secrets,

323
00:20:48,875 --> 00:20:52,083
they could turn on Ching He at any time.

324
00:20:57,541 --> 00:20:59,208
Three men make a tiger.

325
00:20:59,708 --> 00:21:02,083
A lie told often enough becomes the truth.

326
00:21:03,416 --> 00:21:04,583
Don't forget.

327
00:21:05,083 --> 00:21:07,000
Some people try to get back what they lost

328
00:21:07,625 --> 00:21:09,916
the same way it was taken from them.

329
00:21:12,208 --> 00:21:13,166
Sir,

330
00:21:13,666 --> 00:21:16,875
Tristan's support has been growing lately.

331
00:21:17,666 --> 00:21:19,500
Becoming mayor

332
00:21:19,583 --> 00:21:21,083
is well within reach.

333
00:21:21,166 --> 00:21:22,666
Thanks to you, Madam Fan.

334
00:21:23,166 --> 00:21:26,166
We are grateful for everything Yeh Yueh Tong has done.

335
00:21:26,250 --> 00:21:29,291
It's you who gave Yeh Yueh Tong the chance to prove

336
00:21:29,375 --> 00:21:31,208
that Yeh Yueh Tong can do

337
00:21:31,708 --> 00:21:34,000
anything Ching He can do.

338
00:21:34,625 --> 00:21:37,166
And we can do it better.

339
00:21:37,666 --> 00:21:40,916
I heard that Ching He has been having some trouble lately.

340
00:21:41,916 --> 00:21:46,083
The way Thackery Huang works will only harm Ching He.

341
00:21:46,708 --> 00:21:48,750
If Ching He's legacy is to continue,

342
00:21:49,500 --> 00:21:52,166
it needs a better leader.

343
00:21:54,458 --> 00:21:55,458
It seems like

344
00:21:56,625 --> 00:21:58,333
you have some ideas.

345
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:02,041
Ching He Temple is the central hub of the organization.

346
00:22:02,541 --> 00:22:05,791
Staying neutral is a thing of the past.

347
00:22:06,291 --> 00:22:10,375
Ching He now needs someone in the dark

348
00:22:10,875 --> 00:22:12,583
and someone in the light.

349
00:22:13,375 --> 00:22:16,916
No one is more qualified than the Hsueh family to be in the light.

350
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:19,791
As for the dark side, leave it to me.

351
00:22:20,833 --> 00:22:22,333
As long as we join forces,

352
00:22:22,833 --> 00:22:25,958
we hold all the cards.

353
00:22:26,958 --> 00:22:28,833
You want to take over Ching He?

354
00:22:29,333 --> 00:22:33,000
I only want to reclaim my rightful position.

355
00:22:36,208 --> 00:22:37,208
I see.

356
00:22:38,291 --> 00:22:39,125
How about this?

357
00:22:39,791 --> 00:22:41,458
Give me one week.

358
00:22:41,958 --> 00:22:43,083
By then,

359
00:22:43,583 --> 00:22:46,083
I will have a satisfactory answer for everyone.

360
00:22:48,041 --> 00:22:49,041
Here.

361
00:22:49,541 --> 00:22:51,250
We haven't played chess in ages.

362
00:22:51,333 --> 00:22:53,333
Let's play a game. What do you say?

363
00:22:53,416 --> 00:22:54,250
Maybe next time.

364
00:22:54,750 --> 00:22:56,000
I have other plans.

365
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:02,416
I have a feeling that we will meet again very soon.

366
00:23:11,083 --> 00:23:13,583
Looks like it's not just Fixer Terra.

367
00:23:13,666 --> 00:23:16,666
Fixers Earth, Arcane, Cosmos, and Eon are also concerned.

368
00:23:16,750 --> 00:23:18,750
Now that management knows,

369
00:23:19,583 --> 00:23:21,541
we need to clean up this mess fast.

370
00:23:21,625 --> 00:23:23,375
Invite Hsiu here.

371
00:23:23,875 --> 00:23:27,666
Tell him we won't charge for the job.

372
00:23:27,750 --> 00:23:28,791
However,

373
00:23:29,500 --> 00:23:33,625
we hope San He can do something for Ching He.

374
00:23:34,916 --> 00:23:37,458
If you fail to take over Ching He

375
00:23:37,541 --> 00:23:39,750
and Ching He turns on you…

376
00:23:41,458 --> 00:23:43,541
That's no small risk.

377
00:23:44,041 --> 00:23:45,833
Sir, do you know

378
00:23:45,916 --> 00:23:47,458
that Ching He Temple houses

379
00:23:47,958 --> 00:23:51,708
a set of classified files that could shake things up at home and abroad?

380
00:23:52,208 --> 00:23:53,291
I have heard of that.

381
00:23:53,375 --> 00:23:54,500
It's the cornerstone

382
00:23:54,583 --> 00:23:57,333
that has allowed Ching He to remain neutral all these years.

383
00:23:59,583 --> 00:24:02,208
These classified files do exist.

384
00:24:02,291 --> 00:24:04,166
They're called the Primordial Files.

385
00:24:06,458 --> 00:24:07,458
Fixer Primordium

386
00:24:07,541 --> 00:24:11,375
was the greatest fixer in Ching He's history.

387
00:24:11,875 --> 00:24:15,041
They handled the most difficult classified jobs.

388
00:24:15,541 --> 00:24:19,750
Only the heads of Ching He know where the files are.

389
00:24:20,250 --> 00:24:23,291
However, Thackery Huang doesn't,

390
00:24:24,625 --> 00:24:26,166
while I do.

391
00:24:27,916 --> 00:24:31,250
If I have your support in dealing with Thackery Huang,

392
00:24:31,750 --> 00:24:36,166
we will be able to control both sides of the law.

393
00:24:37,708 --> 00:24:40,291
I will be your most powerful ally.

394
00:24:46,708 --> 00:24:47,916
This bridge

395
00:24:48,750 --> 00:24:50,625
connects two sides of the city.

396
00:24:51,500 --> 00:24:54,791
One side symbolizes order and power.

397
00:24:55,416 --> 00:24:56,375
The other,

398
00:24:56,875 --> 00:24:59,041
opportunity and ambition.

399
00:25:00,458 --> 00:25:01,708
It's not opposition…

400
00:25:05,375 --> 00:25:06,708
but symbiosis.

401
00:25:16,458 --> 00:25:18,791
THREE-IN-ONE COMBO, AMAZING VALUE

402
00:25:19,708 --> 00:25:21,250
TWENTY MILLION DOLLARS ONLY

403
00:25:21,333 --> 00:25:23,875
I don't know if your husband ever told you about my job.

404
00:25:23,958 --> 00:25:27,166
He took out a life insurance policy with our company.

405
00:25:27,666 --> 00:25:30,166
He left it to you and your child.

406
00:25:30,666 --> 00:25:32,708
We hope this helps during this difficult time.

407
00:25:37,666 --> 00:25:39,000
He was always like this.

408
00:25:39,500 --> 00:25:41,000
Refusing to tell me anything.

409
00:25:41,083 --> 00:25:42,875
Shouldering everything on his own.

410
00:25:42,958 --> 00:25:44,458
I don't want this money.

411
00:25:45,916 --> 00:25:47,333
I just want him back.

412
00:25:53,333 --> 00:25:54,583
Our condolences.

413
00:25:58,708 --> 00:25:59,875
I know

414
00:26:00,458 --> 00:26:02,583
this isn't an insurance payout.

415
00:26:06,500 --> 00:26:07,833
Thank you.

416
00:26:14,416 --> 00:26:15,583
I'm very sorry.

417
00:26:28,416 --> 00:26:29,625
It's all my fault.

418
00:26:30,291 --> 00:26:32,083
If I hadn't shot and injured him,

419
00:26:33,166 --> 00:26:34,625
he wouldn't have died.

420
00:26:35,541 --> 00:26:37,500
Stop flattering yourself.

421
00:26:38,208 --> 00:26:39,625
Being a fixer has its risks.

422
00:26:39,708 --> 00:26:41,875
That's the price he paid for doing this job.

423
00:26:42,708 --> 00:26:44,375
We've laid Fixer Shadow to rest.

424
00:26:44,875 --> 00:26:47,291
Fixer Expunge and the others will handle the rest.

425
00:26:50,750 --> 00:26:52,500
Haven't we already wrapped things up?

426
00:26:53,333 --> 00:26:54,708
When a fixer dies,

427
00:26:54,791 --> 00:26:56,875
their partner will bring their body back.

428
00:26:56,958 --> 00:26:59,000
Fixer Expunge will erase all records

429
00:26:59,083 --> 00:27:01,166
that tie them to Ching He.

430
00:27:02,666 --> 00:27:04,916
It's just that some memories can't be erased.

431
00:27:13,791 --> 00:27:15,000
STIR-FRIED SWAMP EEL

432
00:27:15,083 --> 00:27:17,541
By the way, how is the San He case going?

433
00:27:17,625 --> 00:27:19,708
Didn't you say you don't care about San He?

434
00:27:19,791 --> 00:27:23,500
I don't, but I have to mind my partner's business, right?

435
00:27:28,875 --> 00:27:31,291
I injured my hand during the mission that day.

436
00:27:31,958 --> 00:27:33,291
It'll be fine in a few days.

437
00:27:34,416 --> 00:27:36,500
Lin Kuei-pin keeps hounding Hsiu.

438
00:27:37,041 --> 00:27:39,666
He will definitely do something before the ransom is paid.

439
00:27:59,125 --> 00:28:03,916
This gang conflict fully exposes our current mayor's incompetence.

440
00:28:07,708 --> 00:28:10,375
The city of happiness has turned into a city of gangsters.

441
00:28:10,458 --> 00:28:13,875
Mayor, please come forward and apologize to our citizens.

442
00:28:13,958 --> 00:28:16,000
Fuck you, Lin Kuei-pin!

443
00:28:16,500 --> 00:28:18,041
TRAITOR

444
00:28:18,125 --> 00:28:19,333
Don't neglect your duties

445
00:28:19,416 --> 00:28:21,166
just because you are stepping down.

446
00:28:21,250 --> 00:28:25,375
Please continue to safeguard our citizens.

447
00:28:43,416 --> 00:28:46,416
I told you to wear a disguise. Why are you dressed for fishing?

448
00:28:47,916 --> 00:28:50,041
If you're gonna do it, do it with some heart.

449
00:28:50,125 --> 00:28:53,333
Make the villains take the bait.

450
00:28:53,416 --> 00:28:54,250
Got it?

451
00:28:54,333 --> 00:28:56,000
Look at you wearing shades at night.

452
00:28:56,083 --> 00:28:57,583
Are you sure you can see?

453
00:29:26,916 --> 00:29:28,166
Not again.

454
00:29:30,333 --> 00:29:31,666
What's the deal now?

455
00:29:31,750 --> 00:29:34,333
Is Yeh Yueh Tong butting into all of Ching He's cases now?

456
00:29:34,416 --> 00:29:37,166
We have a common target, Lin Wan-li.

457
00:29:37,666 --> 00:29:39,458
It has nothing to do with Yeh Yueh Tong.

458
00:29:40,666 --> 00:29:42,041
We're cooperating this time.

459
00:29:42,583 --> 00:29:43,708
No objections, right?

460
00:29:44,291 --> 00:29:46,333
-Fine by me. -Who's asking you?

461
00:29:52,625 --> 00:29:54,291
-Hello? -Did you bring the money?

462
00:29:54,791 --> 00:29:56,250
I'm here to collect it now.

463
00:29:57,041 --> 00:29:58,291
Where are you?

464
00:29:58,375 --> 00:29:59,833
At the next stop,

465
00:30:00,333 --> 00:30:02,000
toss the money out the back door.

466
00:30:02,083 --> 00:30:03,166
Don't get off the bus.

467
00:30:03,666 --> 00:30:05,791
If you miss the stop, your husband will die.

468
00:30:24,333 --> 00:30:25,708
Motherfucker, stop!

469
00:30:26,208 --> 00:30:27,250
No need to chase.

470
00:30:29,500 --> 00:30:31,416
I placed a tracker in the bag.

471
00:30:35,666 --> 00:30:38,250
Hey. We did it!

472
00:30:38,333 --> 00:30:39,875
-What? -We've got a million!

473
00:30:39,958 --> 00:30:41,416
You got it? Where? Show me.

474
00:30:41,500 --> 00:30:43,750
Damn, thank goodness I ran fast,

475
00:30:43,833 --> 00:30:45,333
or I would've been killed.

476
00:30:51,250 --> 00:30:54,666
Take this plate of roast duck and pay respects to our God of Wealth.

477
00:31:01,250 --> 00:31:03,708
God of Wealth, time to eat.

478
00:31:03,791 --> 00:31:05,583
No need to tempt me like this.

479
00:31:05,666 --> 00:31:07,541
I already saw your face.

480
00:31:10,458 --> 00:31:12,583
Who are you kidding? How could you?

481
00:31:12,666 --> 00:31:14,541
Well, I can see my asshole.

482
00:31:15,375 --> 00:31:20,083
Did you dye your hair straw-colored?

483
00:31:24,625 --> 00:31:27,166
-Hey, he saw me! Hey! -What's wrong?

484
00:31:27,250 --> 00:31:28,083
What is it?

485
00:31:28,166 --> 00:31:29,666
-He saw me. -He saw you?

486
00:31:29,750 --> 00:31:31,333
I told you not to use a trash bag.

487
00:31:31,416 --> 00:31:33,291
Never kidnapped anyone before, right?

488
00:31:34,666 --> 00:31:37,250
You only asked San He for one million?

489
00:31:38,041 --> 00:31:40,041
Are you looking down on me

490
00:31:40,125 --> 00:31:42,500
or San He?

491
00:31:42,583 --> 00:31:44,250
-San He? -Hey, what's San He?

492
00:31:44,333 --> 00:31:46,583
How would I know? Don't you know? What's San He?

493
00:31:46,666 --> 00:31:48,125
Lin Wan-li.

494
00:31:48,625 --> 00:31:50,125
You have a phone, right?

495
00:31:50,625 --> 00:31:52,458
-Who is Lin Wan-li? -Google it.

496
00:32:07,458 --> 00:32:08,291
Well? Is he?

497
00:32:08,375 --> 00:32:10,250
-Yes. -Is it him? It's him.

498
00:32:10,833 --> 00:32:12,208
What do we do now?

499
00:32:13,125 --> 00:32:15,458
Fuck, it's your fault. Why San He of all people?

500
00:32:15,541 --> 00:32:17,166
All right, be quiet!

501
00:32:17,250 --> 00:32:18,458
I will figure it out.

502
00:32:18,541 --> 00:32:20,041
Haven't we always been like this?

503
00:32:20,125 --> 00:32:21,416
You and I, brawn and brains.

504
00:32:21,500 --> 00:32:23,083
I'm hungry.

505
00:32:23,708 --> 00:32:25,083
If you feed me well,

506
00:32:25,166 --> 00:32:26,958
I won't rat you out.

507
00:32:27,541 --> 00:32:29,541
He's hungry. What should we do?

508
00:32:39,958 --> 00:32:42,375
Sir, have a duck leg.

509
00:32:47,750 --> 00:32:49,083
What's the deal with you two?

510
00:32:49,166 --> 00:32:52,000
How did you end up resorting to kidnapping?

511
00:32:55,083 --> 00:32:58,625
We lost money playing Texas Hold'em and are drowning in debt.

512
00:32:58,708 --> 00:33:00,041
If we don't pay it off,

513
00:33:00,125 --> 00:33:01,750
we'll lose the rest of our fingers.

514
00:33:02,416 --> 00:33:04,541
How long have you two known each other?

515
00:33:05,041 --> 00:33:06,958
We've been hanging out since we were kids.

516
00:33:07,458 --> 00:33:08,333
We're buddies.

517
00:33:11,750 --> 00:33:13,375
Watching you two

518
00:33:14,250 --> 00:33:17,375
reminds me of two young lads who used to follow me around.

519
00:33:17,875 --> 00:33:19,708
They were very much like you.

520
00:33:20,791 --> 00:33:22,958
But they were smarter.

521
00:33:23,041 --> 00:33:24,666
And more shrewd.

522
00:33:25,458 --> 00:33:28,125
In my whole life, I've never seen anyone

523
00:33:28,625 --> 00:33:30,291
as stupid as you two.

524
00:33:30,791 --> 00:33:32,541
He's talking about you, stupid.

525
00:33:33,875 --> 00:33:37,583
Looking back, the days when those two lads followed me around

526
00:33:38,875 --> 00:33:41,166
were the happiest times of my life.

527
00:33:45,166 --> 00:33:47,250
Was it only my wife who spoke to you guys?

528
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,416
What about other gang leaders?

529
00:33:52,666 --> 00:33:53,708
No.

530
00:33:57,416 --> 00:33:59,791
Tomorrow, I'll head down the mountain

531
00:34:00,625 --> 00:34:03,541
and tell them that I staged everything.

532
00:34:04,125 --> 00:34:06,166
This way, you'll be fine.

533
00:34:06,250 --> 00:34:09,166
Then go pay off your gambling debts.

534
00:34:09,833 --> 00:34:11,625
After that is settled,

535
00:34:12,166 --> 00:34:13,583
come work for me.

536
00:34:13,666 --> 00:34:14,541
Okay.

537
00:34:15,250 --> 00:34:17,625
Boss! Hey, call him boss.

538
00:34:17,708 --> 00:34:19,041
-Boss. -Boss.

539
00:34:21,000 --> 00:34:22,208
Reporting, boss.

540
00:34:22,291 --> 00:34:25,458
Nature calls. I'm going to take a leak.

541
00:34:25,541 --> 00:34:26,791
Go on.

542
00:34:28,500 --> 00:34:30,000
Come, sit.

543
00:35:00,416 --> 00:35:01,375
Hold on.

544
00:35:14,625 --> 00:35:16,250
Who sent you to rescue me?

545
00:35:24,750 --> 00:35:27,208
Who sent you to kill me?

546
00:35:28,208 --> 00:35:31,750
Wan, the crew has come to send you off.

547
00:35:33,125 --> 00:35:34,375
Pin?

548
00:35:35,041 --> 00:35:36,500
That coward.

549
00:35:36,583 --> 00:35:37,875
He wants to kill me

550
00:35:38,625 --> 00:35:40,125
but is afraid to do it himself?

551
00:35:44,416 --> 00:35:45,583
I'm very sorry.

552
00:35:47,083 --> 00:35:49,000
Sharing this meal with you guys

553
00:35:50,291 --> 00:35:51,750
has made me very happy.

554
00:36:05,041 --> 00:36:06,458
Wan-li,

555
00:36:07,375 --> 00:36:08,458
sorry.

556
00:37:07,291 --> 00:37:08,125
Lin Wan-li.

557
00:38:11,833 --> 00:38:13,000
I never thought

558
00:38:14,083 --> 00:38:17,291
we would meet again under these circumstances.

559
00:38:25,958 --> 00:38:26,791
Hang in there.

560
00:38:26,875 --> 00:38:28,166
Wan will be here soon.

561
00:38:33,958 --> 00:38:35,625
Hang in there. It'll be fine.

562
00:38:35,708 --> 00:38:36,958
Hang in there, you hear me?

563
00:38:37,041 --> 00:38:38,125
Hurry and go.

564
00:38:38,625 --> 00:38:40,750
Wan and the others aren't coming.

565
00:38:48,666 --> 00:38:49,500
Hello?

566
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:51,958
Hello, Fixer Lucky?

567
00:38:52,541 --> 00:38:53,708
Where are you guys?

568
00:38:54,958 --> 00:38:57,708
Do you remember the rule I told you?

569
00:39:00,125 --> 00:39:01,916
When a fixer dies…

570
00:39:03,958 --> 00:39:06,375
their partner has to collect their body.

571
00:43:15,083 --> 00:43:17,875
Subtitle translation by: Hannah Liu
